  "note": "Psalm 10:10 does not explicitly identify the subject. The movement is clear, though interpreters differ over whether the predator crouches or the victim sinks. The consonants resemble those of other verbs for bowing. No comparison with a foreign expression for prostration is needed to establish the Hebrew sense."
